   "title": "Note",
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Animate a sprite\nPick an **action** (or `custom` + your own sentence). The preset sets the motion prompt, number of sprite frames, GIF fps and whether it loops. Loops get an automatic loop point; one-shot actions are sampled start→end. Frames are snapped to the sprite's grid and palette, stabilised on the feet and cropped to a uniform size.\nFor guaranteed return-to-start loops use workflow 11."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
